# JOURNEY · a hermit crab is sold with its shell left behind: one Junk lands in the bag.
# A new game holds no items, so the inventory opens only once the shell is in it.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
include scenes/buy-a-fish.play Ermitano Pagu
run /shop
key down
key enter
expect Pagu (Ermitano)
select Pagu (Ermitano)
key enter
expect Sell Pagu for $
key enter
absent Pagu (Ermitano)
key esc
key esc
absent Sell
run /inventory
expect Junk
snap the crab's shell is in the bag
key esc
absent Junk
